1
00:00:00,819 --> 00:00:03,859
- Oh, good, your power's out too.
- Why is that good?

2
00:00:04,531 --> 00:00:07,911
(Penny:)Last month, I sent the electric company
a Starbucks gift card...

3
00:00:08,076 --> 00:00:11,246
(Penny:)...an apology note
and a few snapshots of me in a bra.

4
00:00:13,665 --> 00:00:15,915
(Sheldon:)Power failure.
Implementing power-failure protocol.

5
00:00:17,127 --> 00:00:20,917
(Leonard:)What happened to all your glow-in-the-dark
emergency-exit stuff painted on the floor?

6
00:00:21,089 --> 00:00:23,129
(Sheldon:)Oh, that was wildly carcinogenic.

7
00:00:23,633 --> 00:00:28,343
Anyway, too bad you're no longer entitled
to the full benefits of my friendship...

8
00:00:28,513 --> 00:00:32,223
(Sheldon:)...because I happen to be
extremely prepared for such an emergency.

9
00:00:32,392 --> 00:00:35,142
(Sheldon:)Please try not to see anything
by this light.

10
00:00:35,562 --> 00:00:36,602
(Sheldon:)It's not for you.

11
00:00:38,356 --> 00:00:40,946
It's a blackout,
I'm sure the power will be back on soon.

12
00:00:41,109 --> 00:00:45,409
(Sheldon:)And I'm sure some fool in the Donner Party
said the snow would stop any day now.

13
00:00:47,157 --> 00:00:48,867
(Sheldon:)I like to think they ate him first.

14
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:51,870
I got candles in my apartment.

15
00:00:52,037 --> 00:00:55,377
(Sheldon:)Candles? During a blackout?
Are you mad? That's a fire hazard.

16
00:00:55,540 --> 00:01:01,020
(Sheldon:)No, Pasadena Water and Power
recommends the far safer glow stick.

